          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "D3D9 through DXVK, running on MoltenVK"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "D3DMetal 只来自 Apple 的 Game Porting Toolkit，Vapor 不能代为下载。装了就会自动使用，没装也不影响。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "D3DMetal only comes from Apple's Game Porting Toolkit, and Vapor cannot download it for you. If it is installed, it is used automatically; if not, nothing is affected."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "DXMT 约 19 MB，DXVK 约 3 MB" : {
      "localizations" : {
