        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mac Native"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mac 原生游戏，在 Mac 版 Steam 中安装" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Native Mac game, installed in Steam for Mac"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mac 原生游戏，由 Steam 直接运行。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Native Mac game, run directly by Steam."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mac 版 Steam 会登录同一账号，Windows Steam 随之下线，后台下载暂停。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam for Mac will sign in to the same account, so Windows Steam goes offline and background downloads pause."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mac 版 Steam 正在运行；同一账号同时在线会互相踢下线。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam for Mac is running; being signed in to the same account on both will sign each other out."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mac 版 Steam 没有退出，Windows Steam 无法重新上线。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Steam for Mac has not quit, so Windows Steam cannot come back online."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mac 版 Steam 登录了同一账号" : {
      "localizations" : {
