      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vapor Downloads"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vapor 会在 %@ 创建一个只属于它的 Windows 环境，下载 Steam 官方安装程序（约 2 MB）并静默安装。这一步通常需要一两分钟，Steam 客户端本身在下一步下载。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vapor will create a Windows prefix of its own in %@, download the official Steam installer (about 2 MB) and install it silently. This usually takes a minute or two; the Steam client itself is downloaded in the next step."
          }
        }
      }
    },
