    "变体是 %@ 的 APFS 克隆，只多出各自的图形库，几乎不占磁盘。游戏按渲染器选用对应的变体。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Variants are APFS clones of %@ that add only their own graphics libraries, so they take up almost no disk space. Each game uses the variant that matches its renderer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
