    "图形组件" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Graphics Components"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "图形组件把游戏的 DirectX 转成 Mac 的 Metal。Vapor 会下载 DXMT（约 19 MB）和 DXVK（约 3 MB），再为每种方案生成一份独立的引擎副本，游戏可以按需切换。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Graphics components translate a game's DirectX to Metal on the Mac. Vapor will download DXMT (about 19 MB) and DXVK (about 3 MB), then generate a separate engine copy for each approach, so games can switch as needed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在 Mac 版 Steam 中启动 %@？" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Launch %@ in Steam for Mac?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在 Metal 呈现层完成，D3DMetal、DXMT、MoltenVK 都适用。插帧会多出约一帧延迟。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Done in the Metal presentation layer; works with D3DMetal, DXMT and MoltenVK. Frame interpolation adds about one frame of latency."
          }
        }
      }
    },
